{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01BCFCJi1DNJGdYUWGFgxeKF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All engine tests pass. Now let me start implementing the cards one by one.\n\nLet me start with the KEY_DECISIONS.md file first, then implement E1.\n\n## E1 — Fire SpellCastTriggeredEvent in cast_spell\n\nI need to add firing after `game.stack.push(stack_obj)` in `cast_spell`. The event has fields: `spell` (the StackObject), `card`, `controller`.\n\nLooking at the casting.py code:\n```python\nstack_obj = StackObject(...)\n```\n\nAfter pushing the stack object, I'll fire the SpellCastTriggeredEvent with the spell, card, and controller.\n\n## E2 — Add BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent\n\nI need to define a new triggered event class in events.py, then fire it in game_state.py's advance_phase method right after emptying the mana pools when entering the precombat main phase.\n\nAdding event firing logic...\n\n```\n\npython\nself.trigger_manager.fire_event(self, BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent())\n```\n\nSo the phase gets set first, then mana pools are emptied, and finally I fire the event at the end of `advance_phase()` when we're already in the precombat main phase. Now for the battlefield cost-reduction aggregation — I need to iterate through all permanents on the caster's battlefield and call their `spell_cost_reduction()` method if it exists, then sum up all the reductions.\n\nAdding logic to check if the spell being cast is an instant or sorcery, then looping through each player's battlefield to collect cost reductions from permanents that expose that method...\n\nActually, I need to be careful about the clamping logic here—the reduction should be capped at the generic mana cost, so I should accumulate all the raw reductions first before applying that limit. Let me check what cast_spell does in the test utilities to understand the expected behavior better.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1453,"cache_read_input_tokens":88730,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1453},"output_tokens":36,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ecc45bba-5220-4378-9482-c0a0c3fff5e1","uuid":"7c8668a1-e882-46d4-b02f-17341edbe54b","request_id":"req_011Cbw2WM66wjFZVDyFzba58"}
