{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_012GUK221HNE2R2Z4AquYkJF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see now. For targeting players, looking at fdn_136 (Angel of Finality), when the ETB trigger fires it just gets the chosen target. But to target a player, I need to look at the TargetRequirement and how `choose_target` works.\n\nLooking at cast_spell:\n```python\ntarget_specs = card.get_targets(game)\nchosen_targets: list[Any] = []\nif target_specs:\n    for spec in target_specs:\n        target = player.choose_target(target_specs, spec)\n```\n\nLet me check how DeterministicPlayer implements choose_target.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1716,"cache_read_input_tokens":106622,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1716},"output_tokens":18,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ecc45bba-5220-4378-9482-c0a0c3fff5e1","uuid":"7e742d68-8427-4c88-b1a4-24a9a8a6a84c","request_id":"req_011Cbw2gK8ZPfZby8qrMYcCW"}
