{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01Jbv6mKfb9kZrBsj5UCuzhd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, so loyalty abilities are pushed to the stack and resolved there. The `effect` callable is `ability.effect` which gets called with `(game)`. The targets aren't set on the chosen_targets automatically - I need to set them manually.\n\nFor Ral Zarek's loyalty abilities, the -1 ability targets \"any number of target players\", so we need to prompt for targets. But since targets aren't set by the engine for loyalty abilities (unlike spells), I need to handle targeting within the effect callable.\n\nActually, looking at Chandra (fdn_81)'s +1 ability, which targets creatures, it uses `_resolve_target` which seems to be set somewhere. But TODO says \"do not use `_resolve_target` / `_resolve_targets`\".\nSo I'll handle targeting directly in the effect callbacks for Ral's abilities. For the -1, I'll prompt the controller to choose which players should discard. For the -2, I'll ask them to select a creature from their graveyard with mana value 3 or less. For the -7, I'll flip five coins to determine how many turns the target opponent skips.\n\nWriting effect callbacks... Writing implementation code...","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9105,"cache_read_input_tokens":117554,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9105},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ecc45bba-5220-4378-9482-c0a0c3fff5e1","uuid":"5cbcec1a-3c49-42e6-9dc0-9c1cfa05f139","request_id":"req_011Cbw2yZLoR7qFCkCgbaag7"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01Jbv6mKfb9kZrBsj5UCuzhd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have enough context. Let me start implementing everything systematically."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9105,"cache_read_input_tokens":117554,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9105},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ecc45bba-5220-4378-9482-c0a0c3fff5e1","uuid":"b29290a3-08f7-4fb2-b3d5-10113362a4b8","request_id":"req_011Cbw2yZLoR7qFCkCgbaag7"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01Jbv6mKfb9kZrBsj5UCuzhd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EEfSzYBpS2NatnT3yF64zV","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","content":"# KEY_DECISIONS.md — Implementation Decisions Log\n\nOne-line entries for ambiguous cases, deviations from TODO.md, or deliberate\ncard-local limitations.\n\n## Engine Changes\n\n- **E2 firing point**: `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent` is fired at the\n  end of `advance_phase()` after `empty_mana_pools()`, so handlers can add mana\n  that survives into the main phase.\n\n- **E3 controller check**: battlefield reductions only collected from permanents\n  whose `.controller` is the casting player (not all permanents on all battlefields).\n\n- **Restricted mana (sos_257)**: added `_restricted_instant_sorcery` pool and\n  `_instant_sorcery_context` flag to `ManaPool`. `cast_spell` and `cast_spell_free`\n  set the flag based on card type before payment. Deduction preference: unrestricted\n  mana consumed first, restricted mana only as overflow.\n\n## Per-Card Decisions\n\n- **sos_4**: Two targets — `chosen_targets[0]` = \"target player\" (draws/life),\n  `chosen_targets[1]` = \"any target\" (damage). Controller gains life, target player\n  draws; life gain goes to controller even if controller is also the target player.\n\n- **sos_1 (replacement effect)**: The exile-instead replacement is registered\n  per-cast (inside the attack trigger effect), scoped to the specific card being\n  cast from the graveyard. Only covers spells cast that way; card-local limitation.\n\n- **sos_1 (auto-select)**: If exactly one instant/sorcery in graveyard, the trigger\n  still prompts (\"may\") but the test scripts it normally. The auto-select note in\n  TODO is advisory; the \"may\" wording means the trigger still fires.\n\n- **sos_245 (E3 guard)**: `spell_cost_reduction` checks `spell.controller is self.controller`\n  to gate the reduction to spells cast by Witherbloom's controller. Deliberate limitation:\n  only the casting player's spells are reduced, not all spells.\n\n- **sos_226 (Casualty target selection)**: Trigger prompts via `choose_card`; `None`\n  response (script exhausted or explicit None) means no sacrifice. Power checked at\n  sacrifice time.\n\n- **sos_257 animation**: In-place mutation — adds CREATURE to card_types, sets\n  base_power/base_toughness, adds Wizard subtype, registers pump trigger. The\n  card_impl restores summoning_sick=False (already on battlefield). Animation is\n  idempotent: `if CardType.CREATURE not in self.card_types`.\n\n- **sos_57 (Mana Sculpt mana delay)**: Trigger registered as a one-shot on\n  `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent`, checks active player is the caster.\n  Unregisters itself after firing. \"Mana spent\" = amount tracked at counter time.\n\n- **sos_120 (Paradigm)**: The Paradigm tracking flag `_paradigm_applied` is set\n  on the card object, persisting across the exile/cast cycle. The paradigm trigger\n  is registered once and recurs each main phase. Non-castable cards (lands) stay\n  exiled.\n\n- **sos_13 (SwordsToPlowshares name)**: helper class uses `name=\"Swords to Plowshares\"`.\n  The wrapper creature class uses `name=\"Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\"`.\n\n- **sos_97 (loyalty ability targets)**: Targets chosen within effect callbacks via\n  `player.choose_card`/`choose_yes_no` rather than the engine targeting system (which\n  doesn't wire loyalty ability targets). Deliberate card-local limitation.\n\n- **sos_97 (skip turns)**: `skip_turns` attribute added to Player objects when\n  needed. `advance_phase()` checks/decrements it at turn wrap-around. X=0 skips\n  nothing.\n\n- **sos_97 (coin flip)**: Uses `getattr(game, 'rng', None)` or `random.Random`\n  seeded from game object_id for determinism. Tests seed `game.rng` explicitly.\n\n- **sos_201 (Miracle timing)**: Tracks first draw per turn via a turn-stamped flag\n  on the source. Miracle window: draw trigger fires → check first-draw + instant/sorcery\n  + player has {2} → prompt → pay {2} manually → cast_spell_free from hand.\n\n- **sos_201 (Loot)**: The upkeep loot (discard then draw) fires on opponent's upkeep.\n  Discarding is optional per \"you may discard\"; if player declines, no draw.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9105,"cache_read_input_tokens":117554,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9105},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ecc45bba-5220-4378-9482-c0a0c3fff5e1","uuid":"ffa0f1f8-7051-45f7-b5fe-8319aa26e185","request_id":"req_011Cbw2yZLoR7qFCkCgbaag7"}
