{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01FT4dMtPG588GPURqCC76ZS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see. `set_board_state(game, player_index, hand=[card], mana=mana)` adds the card to hand and sets the mana pool. The mana dict uses `ManaType.COLORLESS` for generic mana, not `ManaType.GENERIC`.\n\nLet me use `set_board_state` with mana parameter to set up the mana instead of directly calling `mana_pool.add`. Also, the `{ManaType.COLORLESS: 2}` dict should work for generic cost spells.\n\nLet me rewrite the tests using `set_board_state` for cleanliness:","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":793,"cache_read_input_tokens":64205,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":793},"output_tokens":42,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ecc45bba-5220-4378-9482-c0a0c3fff5e1","uuid":"b45194e0-64d9-40c8-a95b-1894fe830d53","request_id":"req_011Cbw4AB14Ho26S3fwSeC4X"}
