{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01YAMwHoMK9gjNG9Kddt3ZLf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Looking at the codebase, there's no high-level `ActivateAbility` function in test_utils. The TODO.md refers to it as if it exists, but it doesn't. For land abilities and activated abilities, I need to use `ActivatedAbilityInstance` directly with `activate_ability`.\n\nLooking at the existing FDN tests, many call `card.on_resolve(game)` directly and some set card state directly. For sos_257's land abilities, I'll test by:\n1. Setting up the land on the battlefield\n2. Building the `ActivatedAbilityInstance` from `get_mana_abilities()[0]`\n3. Calling `activate_ability` to resolve it\n\nThis mirrors how the engine handles mana abilities—the cost and effect execute immediately, unlike regular activated abilities which go on the stack.\n\n4. For the animation ability, I need to get it from `get_activated_abilities()`, create an `ActivatedAbilityInstance`, and call `activate_ability` to verify the land becomes a creature. The TODO discourages calling `get_*_abilities()` directly, but since there's no `ActivateAbility` helper in the codebase yet, I'll construct the instance manually as the next best approach.\n\nFor testing the non-mana activated ability, I'll need to handle the stack resolution since activating it pushes to the stack. The tricky part is that the cost function calls `controller.mana_pool.pay()`, which requires having 5 mana available, so I need to set up the test state properly before activation.\n\nThe real challenge is that Land doesn't have `modified_power` or `modified_toughness` properties since it's not a creature by default. When the animation effect runs and sets the base power, I need to make sure those properties exist on the Land object. Resetting the battlefield objects to their base characteristics, then reapplying all effects in sorted order so the continuous effect gets properly reapplied after cleanup.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":291,"cache_read_input_tokens":100142,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":291},"output_tokens":42,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ecc45bba-5220-4378-9482-c0a0c3fff5e1","uuid":"4aaef82d-b6b0-4d5c-b231-7e940efa12bb","request_id":"req_011Cbw4aB2U1VNua5eYw4WoK"}
