{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_016Qsc5BQqKAjCvgJr35EtoW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now there's a problem with the Paradigm: the `on_resolve` runs, which calls `_apply_paradigm` which adds the card to exile. But then the engine normally moves the Sorcery from the stack to the graveyard after `on_resolve` returns. This means the card will be in both exile AND graveyard (or the engine will fail because it can't find it in the stack zone).\n\nLet me think about how the engine handles this...\n\nLooking at `cast_spell_free` in casting.py, the `on_resolve` for a non-permanent is set up like:\nExamining the resolution logic...","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2002,"cache_read_input_tokens":136197,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2002},"output_tokens":26,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ecc45bba-5220-4378-9482-c0a0c3fff5e1","uuid":"67d6b213-a936-40e9-9fc5-f65661715dfa","request_id":"req_011Cbw5D2V3Tji7awK3Xxk6m"}
