{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_014oSimNcrC6k9XoEAC2V9YQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see the critical issue: `_resolve_spell` calls `card.on_resolve(game)` and then moves the card from the stack zone to the graveyard (for sorceries). If my Paradigm code adds the card to exile during `on_resolve`, the engine will then try to `move_to_zone(game, card, Zone.STACK, Zone.GRAVEYARD)` which would move it from the stack zone to the graveyard.\n\nBut wait - `move_to_zone` looks at the card's stack zone (player's zone STACK), not the engine's stack object. \n\nNow I need to trace through what `move_to_zone` actually does when the source is Zone.STACK.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":724,"cache_read_input_tokens":143349,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":724},"output_tokens":23,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ecc45bba-5220-4378-9482-c0a0c3fff5e1","uuid":"b1428928-ff6e-4841-a2b8-2a38a48137b9","request_id":"req_011Cbw5FGkLs3t2VyYt7v2bk"}
