{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   The user invoked the `execute-todo` skill to implement SOS Magic: The Gathering card implementations. The task requires:\n   - Implementing 10 SOS cards in dependency order: sos_4, sos_1, sos_245, sos_226, sos_257, sos_57, sos_120, sos_13, sos_201, sos_97\n   - Writing 2-5 tests per card using the real engine via test_utils\n   - Running `python3 -m pytest engine_tests/ -q` after each card\n   - Committing each card individually\n   - Never stopping to ask questions, logging decisions in `/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md`\n   - E1/E2/E3 shared engine changes already implemented in prior session\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - MTG card engine with zones, triggers, replacement effects, casting pipeline\n   - `TriggerRegistration` / `TriggerManager` for triggered abilities\n   - `cast_spell_free(game, player, card, from_zone)` for free casting\n   - `copy_spell(game, original, controller, new_targets)` for spell copying\n   - `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` (E1), `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent` (E2)\n   - `spell_cost_reduction(game, spell) -> int` for E3 battlefield reductions\n   - `ManaPool.add_restricted()` and `_instant_sorcery_context` for restricted mana\n   - `EffectManager` with `ContinuousEffect` using Layer/SubLayer system for persistent effects\n   - `ActivatedAbilityInstance` from `engine/abilities.py` for direct ability activation in tests\n   - `DeterministicPlayer._script` deque: `appendleft` adds to front, choices pop from front\n   - `_reset_characteristics()` resets `card_types` to `_original_card_types` before `apply_all`\n   - `zone.top(n)` returns last n elements (top of library = last element)\n   - `ManaCost.cmc` is a `@property`, not a method (call without `()`)\n   - `advance_to_phase(game, Phase.BEGINNING, Step.UNTAP)` — BEGINNING phase requires a Step\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_245/card_impl.py` — Witherbloom, the Balancer (committed `8aa75d5`)\n     ```python\n     class WitherbloomTheBalancer(Creature):\n         def cost_reduction(self, game): return _count_creatures(game, self.controller)\n         def spell_cost_reduction(self, game, spell):\n             if spell.controller is not self.controller: return 0\n             return _count_creatures(game, self.controller)\n     def _count_creatures(game, controller):\n         if controller is None: return 0\n         return sum(1 for perm in game.get_battlefield(controller).get_all()\n                    if CardType.CREATURE in getattr(perm, \"card_types\", set()))\n     ```\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py` — 8 tests all passing\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_226/card_impl.py` — Silverquill, the Disputant (committed `3fbe73d`)\n     ```python\n     class SilverquillTheDisputant(Creature):\n         # Flying, Vigilance, 4/4 Legendary Elder Dragon\n         # Casualty 1: SpellCastTriggeredEvent trigger for controller's instants/sorceries\n         def register_triggers(self, game):\n             # condition: event.card is instant/sorcery and event.controller is source.controller\n             # effect: find eligible creatures (power>=1), choose_card to sacrifice,\n             #         find most-recent instant/sorcery on stack via reversed(game.stack._items),\n             #         copy_spell, push copy\n     ```\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_226/tests.py` — 8 tests all passing\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py` — Great Hall of the Biblioplex (committed `bff977c`)\n     ```python\n     class GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex(Land):\n         self._animated: bool = False\n         def get_mana_abilities(self):\n             # Ability 1: _tap_cost → add {C}\n             # Ability 2: _life_tap_cost (tap + life -1) → add_restricted(chosen_color, 1)\n         def get_activated_abilities(self):\n             # {5}: if not animated, pay cost, register permanent ContinuousEffects:\n             #   Layer.TYPE: add CREATURE to card_types\n             #   Layer.POWER_TOUGHNESS / SubLayer.SET_PT: set modified_power=2, modified_toughness=4\n             # Then register SpellCastTriggeredEvent pump trigger (DURATION_END_OF_TURN, MODIFY_PT)\n     ```\n     Key insight: Animation uses permanent `ContinuousEffect` objects because `_reset_characteristics()` resets `card_types` to `_original_card_types` before `apply_all()` re-applies effects. Directly mutating `card_types` would be wiped by `apply_all`.\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py` — 10 tests all passing\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py` — Mana Sculpt (committed `11366c7`)\n     ```python\n     class ManaSculpt(Instant):\n         def can_cast(self, game): # check spell on stack\n         def get_targets(self, game): # Zone.STACK target\n         def on_resolve(self, game):\n             # counter target spell via _counter_spell()\n             # mana_spent = countered_card.mana_cost.cmc  # @property not method!\n             # if _controls_wizard(game, controller): _register_delayed_mana_trigger(...)\n     \n     def _register_delayed_mana_trigger(game, controller, mana_amount):\n         fired = [False]\n         def _condition(game, event): return not fired[0] and game.active_player is controller\n         def _effect(game):\n             if fired[0]: return\n             fired[0] = True\n             controller.mana_pool.add(ManaType.COLORLESS, mana_amount)\n             game.trigger_manager.unregister(_sentinel)\n         _sentinel = object()\n         game.trigger_manager.register(TriggerRegistration(\n             event_type=BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent,\n             condition=_condition, effect=_effect, source=_sentinel, controller=controller\n         ))\n     ```\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py` — 6 tests all passing\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_120/card_impl.py` — Improvisation Capstone (committed `c3a8d0d`)\n     ```python\n     class ImprovisationCapstone(Sorcery):\n         self._paradigm_activated: bool = False\n         def on_resolve(self, game):\n             exiled = _exile_from_library(game, controller)  # peel until MV>=4\n             _offer_cast_exiled(game, controller, exiled)     # may cast any non-land free\n             _apply_paradigm(game, controller, self)          # exile self, register E2 trigger\n     \n     def _apply_paradigm(game, controller, card):\n         # CRITICAL: remove card from stack zone to prevent engine's STACK→GRAVEYARD move\n         stack_zone = controller.zones[Zone.STACK]\n         if stack_zone.contains(card): stack_zone.remove(card)\n         exile_zone = game.get_exile(controller)\n         if not exile_zone.contains(card): exile_zone.add(card)\n         if card._paradigm_activated: return\n         card._paradigm_activated = True\n         _register_paradigm_trigger(game, controller, card)\n     ```\n     Key pattern: `move_to_zone(STACK→GRAVEYARD)` is blocked by removing card from stack zone; the engine safety check at line 256 returns early when the card can't be found.\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_120/tests.py` — 7 tests all passing\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/card_impl.py` — Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares (IN PROGRESS, tests failing)\n     ```python\n     class EmeritusOfTruceSwordsToPlowshares(Creature):\n         # \"Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\" — 3/3 Legendary Cat Cleric {1}{W}{W}\n         self._prepared: bool = False\n         def register_triggers(self, game):\n             # EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent condition: event.permanent is source\n             # effect: choose target player, create_token(game, target_player, Inkling{1/1 Flying})\n             #         check if any opponent has more creatures → self._prepared = True\n         def get_activated_abilities(self):\n             # Prepared ability: if _prepared, cast SwordsToPlowshares copy from exile, unprepare\n     \n     class SwordsToPlowshares(Instant):\n         # Target creature; exile it; controller gains life = power\n         def get_targets(self, game):\n             return [TargetRequirement(filter_fn=lambda obj: CardType.CREATURE in ..., zone=Zone.BATTLEFIELD)]\n         def on_resolve(self, game):\n             power = getattr(target, \"power\", 0)\n             target_controller = getattr(target, \"controller\", None)\n             _exile(game, target)\n             if target_controller and power > 0: target_controller.life += power\n     ```\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py` — Written, 2 tests failing:\n     1. `test_etb_creates_inkling_for_target_player`: Inkling not on p2's battlefield\n     2. `test_prepared_when_opponent_strictly_more`: `_prepared` not set to True\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **`ManaType.GENERIC` doesn't exist**: Fixed to `ManaType.COLORLESS` in sos_226 tests.\n   - **Insufficient mana for {5}{R}{R} with {COLORLESS: 7}**: Fixed to `{ManaType.COLORLESS: 5, ManaType.RED: 2}` in sos_120 tests.\n   - **`mana_cost.cmc()` TypeError**: `ManaCost.cmc` is a `@property`, call as `mana_cost.cmc` (without parentheses) in sos_57.\n   - **`advance_to_phase(game, Phase.BEGINNING)` ValueError**: `BEGINNING` phase requires a Step. Fixed to `advance_to_phase(game, Phase.BEGINNING, Step.UNTAP)`.\n   - **Game state PRECOMBAT_MAIN with step=None**: When setting game.phase manually, must also set `game.step = None`. Otherwise `advance_phase()` fails with `(PRECOMBAT_MAIN, UNTAP) not in list`. Fixed in sos_120 `_cast_capstone`.\n   - **Library order confusion in test**: `zone.top(1)[0]` returns the LAST element (top of library). Fixed sos_120 test to add big first (bottom), land second (top).\n   - **sos_120 advance_to_phase in paradigm tests**: When currently in PRECOMBAT_MAIN, must advance to POSTCOMBA